  │   s S         Stop · focused / all                            [           Older mark                   │
  │   r R         Restart · focused / all                         ]           Newer mark                   │
  │   b B         Build · focused / all                           '           Marks: every column's, to j… │
  │   q           Quit                                            + -         Widen / narrow the focused … │
  │ Tools                                                         =           Equal column widths          │
  │   d           Switch database                                 |           Layout: columns → next       │
  │   i           Install packages: npm ci or npm install         Ctrl+L      Clear output                 │
  │   i c         npm ci                                          Ctrl+R      Reload window                │
  │   i n         npm install                                     t           Theme picker (Default)       │
  │   w W         Open in the browser · focused / all           Help                                       │
  │   o           Open the focused app's log file                 ,           Settings (on/off toggles, r… │
  │   y           Copy (yank)                                     ?           Key reference                │
  │   D           Durations                                       :           Command palette              │
  │   H           Requests: what the .NET apps served           Navigate                                   │
  │   M           Migrations: what's applied to the database      h l Tab     focus another column         │
  │   T           Tests: run the project's test suites            1-5         jump to a column             │
  │   L           lazygit: git without leaving lazyrunner         j k ↑ ↓     scroll a line                │
  │   x           Menu for the focused app                        ^u ^d ^b ^f half page / page (PgUp PgDn) │
  │ View                                                          gg G < >    oldest / follow new output   │
  │   /           Search the focused app's output                 n N Esc     search: older / newer / cle… │
